So you're gonna take the chunks

00:25:21.350 --> 00:25:23.320
and let's pop that in the blender.

00:25:23.320 --> 00:25:24.153
Lovely.

00:25:24.153 --> 00:25:25.900
And then you're gonna
have some stock actually.

